InverseMouseArea: Qt Quick 2 mouse events

It filtered QGraphicsScene events, which a QQuickWindow never sends, so a tap outside a focused
field neither unfocused it nor closed the keyboard. Now it reads the window's mouse events.
Presses on the keyboard never reach the window (another X window), so no check is needed.

